<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Bank of New York rated buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Bank of New York rated buy.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Nomura Securities said it initiated coverage of Bank of New York Co Inc with a buy rating.</p>
<p>-- estimated earnings of $2.35 per share for 1996, $2.80 for 1997, and $3.11 for 1998.</p>
<p>-- said company is &quot;dominant player in high-return fee businesses,&quot; including securities processing.</p>
<p>-- set 12-month price target of $39.</p>
<p>-- Shares were down 1/8 at 32-1/2 in midmorning exchange trade.</p>
</text>
